exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand auth/password-reset: auth/password-reset text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


RESET YOUR PASSWORD

Hi Sarah Khan,

Password Reset Requested

We received a request to reset the password for your Infinia Transfers account. Follow the steps below to set a new password.

How to reset your password:

 1. Click the reset button below
 2. Set your new password
 3. Log back in with your new credentials

Reset Password https://infiniatransfers.com/reset?token=abc

Link expires: 1 hour from the time of this email

Reset URL: https://infiniatransfers.com/reset?token=abc

Security Notice

If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged. If you're concerned about your account security, please contact our support team immediately.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

