e="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">This verification link will expire in 24 hours for security reasons.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">If you didn&#x27;t create an account with Infinia Transfers, please ignore this email or contact our support team.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Best regards,<br/>The Infinia Transfers Team</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:0 40px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e6ebf1;margin-top:32px;padding-top:32px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Infinia Transfers<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/terms" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Terms of Service</a> | <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/cont