exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand auth/welcome: auth/welcome text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


WELCOME TO INFINIA TRANSFERS, SARAH KHAN!

Thanks for creating an Infinia Transfers account.

Verify your email address to finish setting up your account:

Verify Email Address https://infiniatransfers.com/verify?token=abc

Or copy and paste this link into your browser:

https://infiniatransfers.com/verify?token=abc

This verification link will expire in 24 hours for security reasons.

If you didn't create an account with Infinia Transfers, please ignore this email or contact our support team.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

