yle="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e2e8f0;margin:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#333333">Total Amount</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#333333;text-align:right">AED<!-- --> <!-- -->450.00</td></tr><tr><td colSpan="2" style="padding:2px 0;font-size:13px;color:#666666;text-align:right">Payment charged in <!-- -->USD<!-- --> <!-- -->122.00</td></tr></tbody></table><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e2e8f0;margin:16px 0"/><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#2d3748;margin:8px 0;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><strong>Special Requests:</strong> <!-- -->Please call on arrival.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/invoice/1" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#556cd6;border-radius:5px;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;padding:12px 24px;margin:16px 0;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Download Invoice (PDF)</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:24px;color:#666666;margin:0 0 16px;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Keep this invoice for your records.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">We&#x27;ll send you updates about your booking, including vendor assignment and any changes to your reservation.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">To change this booking or ask a question, contact support with your trip number.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Thanks for booking with Infinia Transfers.<br/><br/>Best regards,<br/>The Infinia Transfers Team</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:0 40px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e6ebf1;margin-top:32px;padding-top:32px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Infinia Transfers<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/terms" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Terms of Service</a> | <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/contact" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Contact Support</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand booking/confirmation: booking/confirmation text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


BOOKING CONFIRMATION

Hi Sarah Khan,

Your booking is confirmed. Here are the details:

Trip #: TR-01

----------------------------------------

Vehicle Category: Business

Vehicle Type: Sedan

Up to 3 passengers · Up to 2 luggage

----------------------------------------

Pickup Location: DXB Terminal 3

Pickup Date & Time: 12 August 2026 at 09:30

Passengers: 2 adults, 1 child

----------------------------------------

Dropoff Location: Burj Al Arab

----------------------------------------

Booking Summary

Base Fare (3 Passengers)AED 400.00Child seat (age 4)AED 30.00Meet and greetAED 20.00

----------------------------------------

Total AmountAED 450.00Payment charged in USD 122.00

----------------------------------------

Special Requests: Please call on arrival.

Download Invoice (PDF) https://infiniatransfers.com/invoice/1

Keep this invoice for your records.

We'll send you updates about your booking, including vendor assignment and any changes to your reservation.

To change this booking or ask a question, contact support with your trip number.

Thanks for booking with Infinia Transfers.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

