exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand contact/submission-confirmation: contact/submission-confirmation text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


WE'VE RECEIVED YOUR MESSAGE

Dear Sarah Khan,

We've received your message and will get back to you shortly.

Subject: Question about airport pickup

Message: Do you cover Al Maktoum?

We typically respond within 24 hours during business days. If your matter is urgent, call us directly.

Best regards,
Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

