exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand direct-booking/customer-confirmation: direct-booking/customer-confirmation text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


YOUR BOOKING

Hi Sarah Khan,

Dunes Fleet has recorded your booking. Here are the details. Please keep this email for your records.

Booking Reference: DB-2026-0001

Status: Confirmed

----------------------------------------

Vehicle: Toyota Previa

Registration: DXB-12345

Driver: Omar Aziz

Driver Phone: +971500000001

----------------------------------------

Pickup: DXB Terminal 3

Pickup Date & Time: 12 August 2026 at 09:30

Drop-off: Burj Al Arab

Return Date & Time: 14 August 2026 at 18:00

----------------------------------------

Total: AED 900.00

Paid: AED 450.00 (Part paid)

Balance Due: AED 450.00

Payment Method: Cash

Your Notes

Please call on arrival.

----------------------------------------

Questions or changes? Contact Dunes Fleet on +971500000002 and quote your booking reference.

Best regards,
Dunes Fleet

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

