exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand direct-booking/driver-assignment: direct-booking/driver-assignment text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


TRIP ASSIGNED TO YOU

Hi Omar Aziz,

Dunes Fleet has assigned you to booking #DB-2026-0001.

Booking Reference: DB-2026-0001

----------------------------------------

Customer: Sarah Khan

----------------------------------------

Vehicle: Toyota Previa

Registration: DXB-12345

----------------------------------------

Pickup: DXB Terminal 3

Pickup Date & Time: 12 August 2026 at 09:30

Drop-off: Burj Al Arab

Return Date & Time: 14 August 2026 at 18:00

Action Required

Please confirm you are available for this pickup. If you have a conflict, tell Dunes Fleet as soon as possible so the job can be reassigned.

----------------------------------------

Questions about this trip? Contact Dunes Fleet on +971500000002.

Best regards,
Dunes Fleet

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

