exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand driver/booking-unassigned: driver/booking-unassigned text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


TRIP REMOVED

Hi Omar Aziz,

You have been removed from trip #TR-01.

Trip Details:

Trip #: TR-01

Customer: Sarah Khan

Pickup Location: DXB Terminal 3

Pickup Date: 12 August 2026

Pickup Time: 09:30

Reason: Vehicle unavailable

You no longer need to be available for this trip. Your schedule has been updated accordingly.

----------------------------------------

If you have any questions, please contact Dunes Fleet directly.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

