exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand vendor/application-received: vendor/application-received text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


APPLICATION RECEIVED

Hi Dunes Fleet,

We've received your vendor application.

Application Reference: VA-9

Submitted Date: 10 August 2026

What happens next?

Review takes 3-5 business days. We'll assess your:

 * Company information and credentials
 * Vehicle fleet details
 * Service area coverage
 * Compliance with our quality standards

You'll receive an email notification once we've completed our review. If we need any additional information, we'll reach out to you directly.

Important: Please keep your application reference number (VA-9) for your records.

Contact vendor support if you have questions in the meantime.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

