exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand vendor/booking-assigned: vendor/booking-assigned text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


NEW BOOKING ASSIGNED

Hi Dunes Fleet,

A new booking #TR-01 has been assigned to your company.

Booking Details:

Trip #: TR-01

Customer: Sarah Khan

Vehicle Category: Business

Vehicle Type: Sedan

Pickup Location: DXB Terminal 3

Dropoff Location: Burj Al Arab

Pickup Date: 12 August 2026

Pickup Time: 09:30

View My Bookings https://infiniatransfers.com/vendor/bookings/1

Action Required

Please review this booking and ensure you have a driver and vehicle available for the scheduled pickup. Accept the assignment from your vendor dashboard.

----------------------------------------

If you have any questions about this booking, please contact our support team.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

