in-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><strong>Status:</strong> Frozen</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e2e8f0;margin:16px 0"/><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#2d3748;margin:8px 0;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><strong>Reason:</strong> <!-- -->Pending compliance review</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e2e8f0;margin:16px 0"/><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#2d3748;margin:8px 0;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><strong>Frozen By:</strong> <!-- -->Platform admin</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#2d3748;margin:8px 0;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><strong>Freeze Date:</strong> <!-- -->10 August 2026</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><strong>What this means:</strong></p><ul style="margin:0 0 16px 0;padding-left:24px"><li style="color:#525f7f;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0">You cannot use wallet funds for new bookings or transactions</li><li style="color:#525f7f;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0">Your current balance remains secure and unchanged</li><li style="color:#525f7f;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0">You can still add funds to your wallet</li><li style="color:#525f7f;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0">All pending transactions will be affected</li></ul><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Please contact our support team to resolve the issue and have your wallet unfrozen. Our team is here to help and will work with you to address the situation.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/support" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration:underline">Contact Support Team →</a></p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">When contacting support, please reference the freeze reason above to expedite the resolution process.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#525f7f;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Best regards,<br/>The Infinia Transfers Team</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:0 40px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e6ebf1;margin-top:32px;padding-top:32px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Infinia Transfers<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:4px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#8898aa;margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/terms" style="color:#556cd6;text-decoration-line:none;text-decora