exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand wallet/wallet-frozen: wallet/wallet-frozen text 1`] = `
"INFINIA TRANSFERS


WALLET FROZEN

Hi Acme Hotel Group,

Your wallet has been frozen!
You cannot use wallet funds until the freeze is lifted.

Your wallet has been temporarily frozen by our team. While your wallet is frozen, you will not be able to use wallet funds for bookings or transactions.

Current Balance: AED 750.00

----------------------------------------

Status: Frozen

----------------------------------------

Reason: Pending compliance review

----------------------------------------

Frozen By: Platform admin

Freeze Date: 10 August 2026

What this means:

 * You cannot use wallet funds for new bookings or transactions
 * Your current balance remains secure and unchanged
 * You can still add funds to your wallet
 * All pending transactions will be affected

Next Steps:

Please contact our support team to resolve the issue and have your wallet unfrozen. Our team is here to help and will work with you to address the situation.

Contact Support Team → https://infiniatransfers.com/support

When contacting support, please reference the freeze reason above to expedite the resolution process.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy | Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms | Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;
